From 8bc5e3489c1eea7321d99f89325ee8835f326386 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:24:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/44] Widget lyrics: redraw when the next word is due, not
 once a second

The widget was redrawn on a fixed second, so a word lit up to a second after
it was sung and the lyrics stepped slowly. The service now waits until the
next word (less a 300 ms lead for the launcher) or the next line, and only
redraws when the lyric frame changed; the seek bar keeps its two-second
cadence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013jYn4VRuj8hDnUMoGaHYVa
