Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:31:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/44] Streams: try every visionOS identity, so one being
 closed does not cost the client

Only VISIONOS was in the playback chains; VISIONOS_0_1 existed but was used
only by the desktop probe. Adds VISIONOS_APP (the Vision Pro app's own user
agent) and VISIONOS_1_04, as in the other project's YouTubeClient.kt, and a
VISIONOS_ALL list - VISIONOS, VISIONOS_APP, VISIONOS_1_04, VISIONOS_0_1 -
that the Android default and explicit chains and the desktop player now ask
in turn before the ANDROID_VR clients. The two new ones are in ClientProbe.

