From 3129581ba5730a051407789656cc3152523538dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:24:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/44] Widget lyrics: highlight style and smooth-word
 settings, lit by stage within a word

The widget lit a whole word at once. Words now carry their end times, and
the word being sung is lit in eight stages, the widget redrawn once per
stage: as a fade (the word brightening) or a sweep (a soft edge crossing
it). Two settings in the widget editor, shown when the widget has lyrics:
Highlight style (same as the player / sweep / fade) and Smooth word
animation (off lights each word at once and redraws far less - the
battery-friendly choice).

A widget is redrawn through the launcher, so this is a stepped
approximation of the player's per-frame highlight, not a copy of it.

