From 2446dd8084d2c684b52868fa509ad1f991807523 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:30:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/44] Add Simple reactive player background (ported from
 InterTune's Living blur)

Cover reduced to soft colour patches that move with the music, driven by an
audio tap in front of the output sink. Costs nothing unless on screen; stands
still on battery saver. Colours setting: cover's main colours or the cover itself.

